			"notes": "1.9 - Update\n\n+ The introduction of the Apec Texture Pack Registry\n          - You can open it with /apectpr and it is basically an in game texturepack downloader\n+ Added the ability to right click on buttons in the AH menu\n+ Added a horse jump bar which is located above the hotbar (it is vertical as opposed to the vanilla one)\n+ Added the ability to move the bottom bar up (enable \"Info bar on top\")\t\n+ Added a custom tool tip for items which has kinda like a rarity icon, a star counter for dungeon items and kinda like a light cast on the edges of the tool tip\n+ Added the ability to move the boss bar\n~ Fixed the skill menu to include bestiary/hearth of the mountain/sea creature and pet milestones\n~ Dungeon buffs are no longer considered potions when using the extended potion list\n~ Fixed a crash when you would start with a white space in the setting search bar\n~ Changed the /apecmenu command to /apec"
