			"notes": "1.8 - Update\n\n+ Fixed a bug where if you had an potion effect and drank a potion with the same effect it would show it twice\n+ Fixed the issue where sometime things would appear in the place of time instead of the left side screen\n+ Fixed the wierd trasparend spaces that would appear in the chat\n+ Fixed the commands\n+ Fixed the issue with the AH screen getting the category wrong\n+ Fixed a bug with SBA's tab settings that would make the game crash\n+ Added a search bar in the settings menu\n+ The defence indicator can now be used outisde of the bottom bar by enabling a setting (\"Defence Outside Bar\")\n+ The ability text can be moved separatley from the mana text\n+ Added a compatiblity setting which removes certain features that might break the compatiblity with other mods, until now the single feature removed is the ability to rescale the hotbar\n+ Added an option to allow for the use of custom guis even when the apec UI is disabled (\"Allow guis when inactive\")\n+ The bits counter shows 0 bits when you do not have any\n+ The show effects as in tab setting is now on by default\n+ The texture atlas has been reorganized\n+ Updated the logo\n+ Data parsing happens once every 2 ticks instead of every tick\n+ Changed the amout of interference the mod in has in the gui code to hopefully avoid future issues\n+ Added an animation to the customization button when the settings menu is opened\n- Removed the Overwrite guis setting"
